services/api/data/

# Sync-conflict duplicates. iCloud and OneDrive both write "name 2.ext"
# beside the original; they are stale copies, they break the Go build when
# they materialise, and one `git add -A` puts 84 of them in the repository.
*\ 2.go
*\ 2.sql
*\ 2.py
*\ 2.ts
*\ 2.tsx
*\ 2.json
*\ 2.md
